@startuml
skinparam componentStyle uml2

package "Client Side (Frontend)" {
    [React App (Vite)] as Frontend
    [API Explorer UI] as Explorer
}

package "Server Side (Backend)" {
    [Node.js Express Server] as Server
    [Auth Middleware] as Auth
    [API Key Validator] as KeyCheck
    [Sniper Logic Engine] as Logic
}

database "Data Storage" {
    [MySQL Database] as DB
}

Frontend --> Server : HTTP Request (JSON)
Explorer --> Server : Test Endpoints

Server --> Auth : Login/Register
Server --> KeyCheck : /api/check-travel
KeyCheck --> Logic : If Key Valid
Logic --> DB : Update Hits Count
Auth --> DB : Verify Credentials

@enduml